==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|}}, borrowed either from {{der|fi|gem-pro|*miurijǭ}} (compare {{cog|sv|myra}}), or from its source {{der|fi|ine-pro|*morwi-}} (compare {{cog|ru|мураве́й}}, {{cog|uk|мура́ха}}, {{cog|pl|mrówka}}). Contains a diminutive {{m|fi|-nen|-(i)nen}}.

